.TH KEYKEY-FCITX-APP 1 "20 September 2026" "KeyKey" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
keykey-fcitx-app \- launch one GTK application with the direct Fcitx input context
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keykey-fcitx-app
.I command
.RI [ arguments ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set GTK_IM_MODULE to fcitx for the launched command and its child processes.
Other applications and the desktop session keep their existing input-method
settings. A single-instance application can forward the request to an existing
process; use that application's separate-instance option when available.
